    "body": "The supplied screenshot exposed a real atlas-conversion bug: Lexeditor ignored the installed DDS alpha and made transparent dark pixels visible around the glyphs. Warband inventory icons are renders of each item's first 3D mesh, not separate flat images. I am preserving the real atlas alpha and placing that resolved mesh in the detail heading's top-left icon space.",
